{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00541","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 寿和 · 苏頲","name":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 寿和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"礼物斯具，乐章乃陈。\n谁其作主，皇考圣真。\n对越在天，圣明佐神。\n窅然汾上，厚泽如春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00541.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00541","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}